window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When America declared war on China, they hit a town next to Tow, a small town where Greyson, his brother Lucas, and his parents live. When the bombs first fall, Greyson makes it out after Lucas sacrifices himself for his brother. Greyson meets a strange person, but will they get along? And will they ever make it through what survivors are calling \"The Truce\"?</p>"; 
